- How would you ensure consistent routing decisions across distributed instances when using canary strategies?
- What security considerations exist when letting runtime plugins run code within the router?

## Why This Is Asked
This probes runtime extensibility, plugin patterns, and async composition for feature flags in multi-tenant systems.

